# Pharmacy MIS web app (Node, Puppeteer). The exe build lives on main.
#
# reference/ (sample reports and the field mapping) is checked in on purpose.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets
# The portal pull needs HIS credentials. Nothing resembling them is committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.pfx
*.key
credentials.json
secrets.json

